		<region region-id="148" left="888" top="1205.25" width="710.25" height="1760.25" align-x="890.25" align-y="1218.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Ecuación de estado de Peng - Robinson (PR)</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit" />
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">@Hector Macaño, Gustavo Servetti, Jose Fonseca</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">UTN - FRC - Dpto. Ing. Química (2010 - 2020)</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Este archivo fue elaborado con fines educativos, y los autores no son responsables de su uso.</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit" />
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Descripción:</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Todas las variables deben ser adimensionales (en MathCad)</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">El estado de referencia de la EoS es la sustancia pura, a la temperatura T de la mezcla, a la presión 1 bar (aproximadamente igual a 1 atm), fase gaseosa.</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit" />
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">
					<b>
						<i>Para evaluación de propiedades de mezclas:</i>
					</b>
				</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">
					<region region-id="54" left="888" top="1341.75" width="101.25" height="16.5" align-x="914.25" align-y="1350.75" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
						<math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
							<ns1:apply>
								<ns1:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="V.PR">ϕ</ns1:id>
								<ns1:sequence>
									<ns1:id xml:space="preserve">y</ns1:id>
									<ns1:id xml:space="preserve">T</ns1:id>
									<ns1:id xml:space="preserve">P</ns1:id>
									<ns1:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">T</ns1:id>
									<ns1:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">P</ns1:id>
									<ns1:id xml:space="preserve">ω</ns1:id>
								</ns1:sequence>
							</ns1:apply>
						</math>
						<rendering item-idref="3" />
					</region>
					<inlineAttr font-weight="normal" font-style="normal" underline="false" line-through="false">
						<f family="Arial" charset="0" size="10"> Coeficiente de fugacidad del componente i de la mezcla gaseosa</f>
					</inlineAttr>
				</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">
					<region region-id="55" left="888" top="1359.0" width="99" height="16.5" align-x="913.5" align-y="1368.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
						<math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
							<ns1:apply>
								<ns1:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="L.PR">ϕ</ns1:id>
								<ns1:sequence>
									<ns1:id xml:space="preserve">x</ns1:id>
									<ns1:id xml:space="preserve">T</ns1:id>
									<ns1:id xml:space="preserve">P</ns1:id>
									<ns1:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">T</ns1:id>
									<ns1:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">P</ns1:id>
									<ns1:id xml:space="preserve">ω</ns1:id>
								</ns1:sequence>
							</ns1:apply>
						</math>
						<rendering item-idref="4" />
					</region>
					<inlineAttr font-weight="normal" font-style="normal" underline="false" line-through="false">
						<f family="Arial" charset="0" size="10"> Coeficiente de fugacidad de</f>
					</inlineAttr>l componente i de<inlineAttr font-weight="normal" font-style="normal" underline="false" line-through="false">
						<f family="Arial" charset="0" size="10"> la mezcla líquida</f>
					</inlineAttr>
				</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">
					<inlineAttr font-weight="normal" font-style="normal" underline="false" line-through="false">
						<f family="Arial" charset="0" size="10">Devuelven un vector (Nc x 1), adimensional</f>
					</inlineAttr>
				</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit" />
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">
					<region region-id="398" left="888" top="1400.25" width="98.25" height="16.5" align-x="911.25" align-y="1409.25" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
						<math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
							<ns1:apply>
								<ns1:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="V.PR">f</ns1:id>
								<ns1:sequence>
									<ns1:id xml:space="preserve">y</ns1:id>
									<ns1:id xml:space="preserve">T</ns1:id>
									<ns1:id xml:space="preserve">P</ns1:id>
									<ns1:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">T</ns1:id>
									<ns1:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">P</ns1:id>
									<ns1:id xml:space="preserve">ω</ns1:id>
								</ns1:sequence>
							</ns1:apply>
						</math>
						<rendering item-idref="5" />
					</region> Fugacidad del componente i de la mezcla gaseosa</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">
					<region region-id="399" left="888" top="1417.5" width="96" height="16.5" align-x="910.5" align-y="1426.5" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
						<math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
							<ns1:apply>
								<ns1:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="L.PR">f</ns1:id>
								<ns1:sequence>
									<ns1:id xml:space="preserve">x</ns1:id>
									<ns1:id xml:space="preserve">T</ns1:id>
									<ns1:id xml:space="preserve">P</ns1:id>
