				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">-The Properties of Gases and Liquids, 5<sup>th</sup> edition, Bruce E. Poling, John M. Prausnitz, John O' Connell, @2004 McGraw-Hill. pp 4.17 y ss</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">- Termodinamica molecular de los equilibrios de fase - Prausnitz -<sp count="2" />(Pearson, 2000)</p>
				<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">- A New Two-Constant Equation of State. Ding-Yu Peng and Donald B. Robinson. Ind. Eng. Chem., Fundam., Vol. 15, No. 1, 1976 59-64</p>
			</text>
		</region>
