rit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">--- 1. DEFINICIÓN DE PARÁMETROS Y CONDICIONES DEL SISTEMA ---</p></text></region><region region-id="434" left="18" top="190.0" width="100" height="16.5" align-x="38" align-y="200.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag=""><math optimize="false" disable-calc="false"><ns1:define><ns1:id xml:space="preserve">T</ns1:id><ns1:real>298.15</ns1:real></ns1:define></math></region><region region-id="435" left="150" top="190.0" width="100" height="16.5" align-x="170" align-y="200.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag=""><math optimize="false" disable-calc="false"><ns1:define><ns1:id xml:space="preserve">P</ns1:id><ns1:real>300</ns1:real></ns1:define></math></region><region region-id="436" left="270" top="190.0" width="100" height="16.5" align-x="290" align-y="200.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag=""><math optimize="false" disable-calc="false"><ns1:define><ns1:id xml:space="preserve">R</ns1:id><ns1:real>0.0831447</ns1:real></ns1:define></math></region><region region-id="437" left="18" top="220.0" width="100" height="45" align-x="38" align-y="230.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag=""><math optimize="false" disable-calc="false"><ns1:define><ns1:id xml:space="preserve">y</ns1:id><ns1:matrix rows="3" cols="1"><ns1:real>0.5</ns1:real><ns1:real>0.3</ns1:real><ns1:real>0.2</ns1:real></ns1:matrix></ns1:define></math></region><region region-id="438" left="150" top="220.0" width="100" height="45" align-x="170" align-y="230.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag=""><math optimize="false" disable-calc="false"><ns1:define><ns1:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">T</ns1:id><ns1:matrix rows="3" cols="1"><ns1:real>190.56</ns1:real><ns1:real>305.32</ns1:real><ns1:real>304.13</ns1:real></ns1:matrix></ns1:define></math></region><region region-id="439" left="300" top="220.0" width="100" height="45" align-x="320" align-y="230.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag=""><math optimize="false" disable-calc="false"><ns1:define><ns1:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">P</ns1:id><ns1:matrix rows="3" cols="1"><ns1:real>45.99</ns1:real><ns1:real>48.72</ns1:real><ns1:real>73.77</ns1:real></ns1:matrix></ns1:define></math></region><region region-id="440" left="450" top="220.0" width="100" height="45" align-x="470" align-y="230.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag=""><math optimize="false" disable-calc="false"><ns1:define><ns1:id xml:space="preserve">ω</ns1:id><ns1:matrix rows="3" cols="1"><ns1:real>0.011</ns1:real><ns1:real>0.099</ns1:real><ns1:real>0.224</ns1:real></ns1:matrix></ns1:define></math></region><region region-id="441" left="18" top="290.0" width="700" height="20" align-x="18" align-y="300.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag=""><text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">--- 2. COEFICIENTES DE FUGACIDAD Y FUGACIDADES (PENG-ROBINSON) ---</p><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Evaluación de phi_hat en mezcla, fugacidades parciales f_hat, phi de puros y f de puros:</p></text></region><region region-id="442" left="18" top="335.0" width="700" height="20" align-x="18" align-y="345.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag=""><text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Coeficientes de fugacidad en mezcla (phi_hat_i):</p></text></region><region region-id="443" left="18" top="360.0" width="180" height="45" align-x="68" align-y="370.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag=""><math optimize="false" disable-calc="false"><ns1:eval placeholderMultiplicationStyle="default"><ns1:apply><ns1:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="V.PR">ϕ</ns1:id><ns1:sequence><ns1:id xml:space="preserve">y</ns1:id><ns1:id xml:space="preserve">T</ns1:id><ns1:id xml:space="preserve">P</ns1:id><ns1:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">T</ns1:id><ns1:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">P</ns1:id><ns1:id xml:space="preserve">ω</ns1:id></ns1:sequence></ns1:apply><ns1:result><ns1:matrix rows="3" cols="1"><ns1:real>0.73113</ns1:real><ns1:real>0.20926</ns1:real><ns1:real>0.25912</ns1:real></ns1:matrix></ns1:result></ns1:eval></math></region><region region-id="444" left="18" top="420.0" width="700" height="20" align-x="18" align-y="430.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag=""><text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Fugacidades en la mezcla (f_hat_i = y_i * phi_hat_i * P) [bar]:</p></text></region><region region-id="445" left="18" top="445.0" width="180" height="45" align-x="68" align-y="455.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag=""><math optimize="false" disable-calc="false"><ns1:eval placeholderMultiplicationStyle="default"><ns1:apply><ns1:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="V.PR">f</ns1:id><ns1:sequence><ns1:id xml:space="preserve">y</ns1:id><ns1:id xml:space="preserve">T</ns1:id><ns1:id xml:space="preserve">P</ns1:id><ns1:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">T</ns1:id><ns1:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">P</ns1:id><ns1:id xml:space="preserve">ω</ns1:id></ns1:sequence></ns1:apply><ns1:result><ns1:matrix rows="3" cols="1"><ns1:real>109.67</ns1:real><ns1:real>18.83</ns1:real><ns1:real>15.55</ns1:real></ns1:matrix></ns1:result></ns1:eval></math></region><region region-id="446" left="18" top="505.0" width="700" height="20" align-x="18" align-y="515.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag=""><text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Coeficientes de fugacidad de componentes PUROS (phi_i_puro):</p></text></region><region region-id="447" left="18" top="530.0" width="180" height="45" align-x="68" align-y="540.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag=""><math optimize="false" disable-calc="false"><ns1:eval placeholderMultiplicationStyle="default"><ns1:apply><ns1:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="V.PR.puro">ϕ</ns1:id><ns1:sequence><ns1:id xml:space="preserve">T</ns1:id><ns1:id xml:space="preserve">P</ns1:id><ns1:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">T</ns1:id><ns1:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">P</ns1:id><ns1:id xml:space="preserve">ω</ns1:id></ns1:sequence></ns1:apply><ns1:result><ns1:matrix rows="3" cols="1"><ns1:real>0.67118</ns1:real><ns1:real>0.19736</ns1:real><ns1:real>0.23121</ns1:real></ns1:matrix></ns1:result></ns1:eval></math></region><region region-id="448" left="18" top="590.0" width="700" height="20" align-x="18" align-y="600.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag=""><text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">--- 3. VOLUMEN MOLAR DE MEZCLA Y FACTOR DE COMPRESIBILIDAD (Z) ---</p></text></region><region region-id="449" left="18" top="620.0" width="700" height="20" align-x="18" align-y="630.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag=""><text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Factor de compresibilidad Z_mezcla:</p></text></region><region region-id="450" left="250" top="620.0" width="180" height="20" align-x="300" align-y="630.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag=""><math optimize="false" disable-calc="false"><ns1:eval placeholderMultiplicationStyle="default"><ns1:apply><ns1:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="V.PR">z</ns1:id><ns1:sequence><ns1:id xml:space="preserve">y</ns1:id><ns1:id xml:space="preserve">T</ns1:id><ns1:id xml:space="preserve">P</ns1:id><ns1:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">T</ns1:id><ns1:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">P</ns1:id><ns1:id xml:space="preserve">ω</ns1:id></ns1:sequence></ns1:apply><ns1:result><ns1:real>0.735</ns1:real></ns1:result></ns1:eval></math></region><region region-id="451" left="18" top="655.0" width="700" height="20" align-x="18" align-y="665.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag=""><text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Volumen molar real de mezcla (V_mezcla) [L/mol]:</p></text></region><region region-id="452" left="300" top="655.0" width="180" height="20" align-x="350" align-y="665.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag=""><math optimize="false" disable-calc="false"><ns1:eval placeholderMultiplicationStyle="default"><ns1:apply><ns1:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="V.PR">V</ns1:id><ns1:sequence><ns1:id xml:space="preserve">y</ns1:id><ns1:id xml:space="preserve">T</ns1:id><ns1:id xml:space="preserve">P</ns1:id><ns1:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">T</ns1:id><ns1:id xml:space="preserve" subscript="c">P</ns1:id><ns1:id xml:space="preserve">ω</ns1:id></ns1:sequence></ns1:apply><ns1:result><ns1:real>0.060735</ns1:real></ns1:result></ns1:eval></math></region><region region-id="453" left="18" top="690.0" width="820" height="450" align-x="18" align-y="700.0" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag=""><text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true"><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">==========================================================================================</p><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">RESPUESTAS A LOS APARTADOS DEL EJERCICIO 1</p><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">==========================================================================================</p><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit" /><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">CONSULTA INICIAL DEL INGENIERO:</p><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">1. ¿Se puede asumir idealidad a 300 bar y 25 °C? NO. A 300 bar las moléculas están sumamente comprimidas;</p><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">   el factor de compresibilidad es Z = 0.735 y los coeficientes de fugacidad son muy inferiores a 1</p><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">   (0.731 para CH4, 0.209 para C2H6 y 0.259 para CO2). Asumir gas ideal comete errores de más del 26% en volumen</p><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">   y de hasta 300% en fugacidades, lo que causaría la compra de una válvula incorrecta y su posterior falla.</p><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">2. ¿Puede usar la fugacidad de puros o de mezcla? DEBE USAR LA FUGACIDAD EN MEZCLA (f_hat_i).</p><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">   La regla de Lewis-Randall (y_i * f_puro) ignora las interacciones cruzadas moleculares (CH4-C2H6, CH4-CO2,</p><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">   C2H6-CO2) que a 300 bar alteran sensiblemente el potencial químico de cada especie.</p><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit" /><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">APARTADO A) COMPARACIÓN PARA CADA COMPONENTE:</p><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">   - Metano (1, y1=0.50): f_ideal = 150 bar | f_puro = 201.36 bar | f_Lewis-Randall = 100.68 bar | f_mezcla = 109.67 bar</p><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">   - Etano (2, y2=0.30):  f_ideal = 90 bar  | f_puro = 59.21 bar  | f_Lewis-Randall = 17.76 bar  | f_mezcla = 18.83 bar</p><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">   - CO2 (3, y3=0.20):    f_ideal = 60 bar  | f_puro = 69.36 bar  | f_Lewis-Randall = 13.87 bar  | f_mezcla = 15.55 bar</p><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit" /><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">APARTADO B) VARIACIÓN DE LA PRESIÓN CON LA IDEALIDAD Y FENÓMENOS OBSERVADOS:</p><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">   - Bajas presiones (P &lt; 5 bar): Distancia intermolecular grande, Z ≈ 1, phi ≈ 1. Comportamiento IDEAL.</p><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">   - Presiones intermedias (10 a 150 bar): Predominan las FUERZAS ATRACTIVAS intermoleculares (Van der Waals).</p><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">     El fluido se comprime más que un gas ideal (Z cae a ~0.54, phi &lt; 1).</p><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">   - Altas presiones (P &gt; 200 bar): Domina el EFECTO DE COVOLUMEN (repulsión por volumen molecular propio).</p><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">     Z comienza a crecer nuevamente (0.735 a 300 bar, 0.887 a 400 bar).</p><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit" /><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">APARTADO C) JUSTIFICACIÓN DEL USO DE FUGACIDAD Y DIFERENCIA PURO VS MEZCLA:</p><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">   - Se justifica el uso de fugacidad a partir de P &gt; 5 a 10 bar (cuando el error supera el 3-5%).</p><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">   - ¿Cambia para puros o mezcla? SÍ, cambia. Los compuestos cercanos a su temperatura crítica (como Etano y CO2,</p><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">     con Tc ≈ 31 °C cercano a 25 °C) sufren no-idealidad a presiones mucho más bajas (2-3 bar) que el Metano (Tc = -82 °C).</p><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">     En la mezcla, el Metano actúa diluyendo la condensabilidad de los otros dos, modificando las propiedades pseudocríticas.</p><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit" /><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">APARTADO D) VOLUMEN MOLAR DE MEZCLA VS GAS IDEAL Y USO DE EOS:</p><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">   - V_ideal = R * T / P = 0.08263 L/mol = 82.63 cm3/mol</p><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">   - V_mezcla (PR)       = 0.06074 L/mol = 60.74 cm3/mol (Diferencia = -26.5%)</p><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">   - Se justifica utilizar una EoS a partir de P &gt; 5-10 bar y siempre que se deban dimensionar equipos de proceso</p><p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">     (válvulas, compresores, cañerías de alta presión) para evitar fallas mecánicas o sobrecostos.</p></text></region></regions>
